'''Li'l Madoka''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtaineed when beating any stage in [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event#Be a Magical Girl|Be a Magical Girl]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]]. [[True Form]] added in Version 5.5 increases range and area of effect and grants [[Area Attack|Area Attacks]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 299
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Li'l Madoka
|name2 = Li'l Magical Girl Madoka
|name3 = Li'l Ultimate Madoka
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Li'l Magical Girl Madoka''' at level 10.

Evolves into '''Li'l Ultimate Madoka''' after clearing [[Walpurgisnacht (Gauntlet)/Stagebuilding Witch: Cycle 1~10|Stagebuilding Witch: Cycle 1]] and is level 20 or above.

==Strategy/Usage==
During her collab, she can be useful with [[Li'l Homura (Special Cat)|Li'l Homura]] for a powerful [[Cat Combo|combo]] to handle [[:Category:Witch Enemies|Witches]]. Against some of the tougher Witch stages, she is a staple, both for the combo and her boosted stats.

Unfortunately, outside of this collab, her stats are too pitiful to shine beyond the early game, even against Floating enemies. Her LD is decent at best, but her large blindspot severely limits her. She is still cheap enough to boost for extra [[User Rank]], but beyond that, her only place is the [[Underground Labyrinth]]. Her [[True Form]] is unable to save her.

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave|EvolvedClass = Backliner & Combo Slave|UltraClass=}}

